00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.080
A different Verbalism Ability?

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.350
Is that what drew in the M.J.B.K.s and made them more active?

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:20.750
You were still alive then, Subete.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.020
