Kou!

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.080
You're Subete, aren't you?

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.710
Wall.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.750
Quick.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.290
Maia!

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.570
Can you see it? The answer he has chosen.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:20.980
The answer your son has chosen.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:25.750
At one time, man was one with the world of truth.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:31.320
But the written word brought forth prosperity and suffering.

